{"id":"n25066-2-7","stage":3,"title":"인물 · 长相","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25066-2-7-1","ko":"우리 아들, 머리 깎으니 인물이 훤하네.","zh":"我们儿子剪了头发，看起来精神多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아들,","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깎으니","meaning":"剪","explanation":"깎다：剪；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"깎다","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57278","senseId":"2","lemma":"깎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인물이","meaning":"长相，容貌","explanation":"인물：长相，容貌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인물","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25066","senseId":"2","lemma":"인물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훤하네.","meaning":"清秀，白净","explanation":"훤하다：清秀，白净；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"훤하다","audio":"/audio/922c5e9b800a57ceb0b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87760","senseId":"4","lemma":"훤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"18d3575b885757d9","term":"깎다","zh":"剪","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3","entryId":"57278","definition":"把草或毛等切短。","pronunciation":["깍따"]},{"id":"16673e931e1465c5","term":"인물","zh":"长相，容貌","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3","entryId":"25066","definition":"人的样子。","pronunciation":["인물"]},{"id":"922c5e9b800a57ce","term":"훤하다","zh":"清秀，白净","audio":"/audio/922c5e9b800a57ceb0b5.mp3","entryId":"87760","definition":"外貌好看，看起来很舒服。","pronunciation":["훤ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3a96d21a76955cc362ae.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25066-2-7-2","ko":"시간이 없어서 그냥 뒀는데 자르니 시원해요.","zh":"因为没时间，就没剪，现在剪了感觉清爽多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어서","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒀는데","meaning":"放任，撇下，搁置","explanation":"두다：放任，撇下，搁置；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"16","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자르니","meaning":"剪掉，切掉","explanation":"자르다：剪掉，切掉；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"자르다","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17787","senseId":"4","lemma":"자르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시원해요.","meaning":"舒畅，舒服","explanation":"시원하다：舒畅，舒服；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"7","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"放任，撇下，搁置","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"不做某事而往后推迟。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"1d818f15fdfd54e5","term":"자르다","zh":"剪掉，切掉","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3","entryId":"17787","definition":"从整体中将一部分拿掉。","pronunciation":["자르다"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"舒畅，舒服","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"郁闷的心情得到缓解，轻松痛快。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e15751f80a485f3851a0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.025,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25066","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":98,"sequenceScore":2.6226,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为没时间，就没剪，现在剪了感觉清爽多了。","要自己动手包装礼物吗？","我们儿子剪了头发，看起来精神多了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为没时间，就没剪，现在剪了感觉清爽多了。","我们儿子剪了头发，看起来精神多了。","要自己动手包装礼物吗？"],"answer":0}]}
